---
description: Testing conventions
globs: ["**/tests/**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- API tests use the `client` and `auth(...)` fixtures; cover success, 401, 403, 404 envelope (`error.code`, `request_id`), 422 `fields`.
- Unit tests test the service with a fake repository: no DB, no HTTP.
- Never delete or skip `tests/test_architecture.py`.
